- Hey, Guy. - Hi, I'm Guy. Pleasure.

242
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:46,620
-你好 盖 -你好
- Hi, Guy. - Hi.

243
00:07:47,900 --> 00:07:49,140
好酒啊
Oh. Very nice.

244
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:50,340
2002年产的哈伦
2002 Harlan.

245
