Well, you must be very good neighbors.

249
00:07:56,820 --> 00:07:58,500
-真感谢你 -谢谢
- That's so nice. - Thank you.

250
00:07:58,640 --> 00:07:59,740
这没什么
Oh, don't mention it.

251
