到底去哪里上大学
where she's gonna go to college,

256
00:08:08,980 --> 00:08:11,100
我们很担心她会去东海岸
and we're freaking out it's gonna be on the east coast.

257
00:08:11,340 --> 00:08:13,081
是嘛 我们懂的
Oh, yeah. Well, we get that.

258
00:08:13,081 --> 00:08:14,638
R.J.很快要去纽约
R.J.'s going to New York soon.

259
00:08:14,638 --> 00:08:16,060
