不行也得去
You have to.

318
00:10:32,400 --> 00:10:35,281
我们对杰和小卡夸下海口 要是不去
We talked so big to Cam and Jay that if we don't go out,

319
00:10:35,281 --> 00:10:37,420
他们会取笑我们一辈子
they're never gonna let us live it down.

320
00:10:38,140 --> 00:10:38,420
好吧
Okay.

321
00:10:39,509 --> 00:10:41,540
或者就不去了吧
Or we could just blow it off, man.

322
00:10:41,540 --> 00:10:42,278
别呀歌洛莉亚 起来
No, Gloria, come on, come on.

323
00:10:42,278 --> 00:10:44,076
起来 起来 来来来
Get up, get up. Come on, come on, come on.

324
00:10:44,076 --> 00:10:45,340
熬通宵是你的本性呢
Staying up all night -- it's in your blood.

325
00:10:45,340 --> 00:10:47,220
你的家乡遍地是咖啡和可卡因呢
You come from the land of coffee and cocaine!

326
00:10:47,340 --> 00:10:50,040
你也是啊 有谁比基友更爱跳舞
You too! Nobody likes to dance more than the gays.

327
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:51,221
假装你嗨了
Pretend you're on a float.

328
00:10:51,221 --> 00:10:52,510
对 跳舞 好主意
Dancing. That's it. That's a good idea.

329
00:10:52,510 --> 00:10:53,560
好 跳起来
Okay, dancing. Dancing.

330
