我来放音乐
I'm gonna turn on some music here.

331
00:10:56,300 --> 00:10:57,180
不错哦
This is good.

332
00:10:59,713 --> 00:11:02,109
胳膊酸 跳不了"掀房顶"舞姿了
Oh, my "Raise the roof" elbow's a little sore.

333
