他们的脸原来长啥样了
what their actual faces look like.

337
00:11:11,840 --> 00:11:13,760
很有趣 对吧
This is fun. Isn't this fun?

338
00:11:14,180 --> 00:11:16,360
今天聚在一起是因为我们
To think it just took us all hating the same statue

339
