Or...how about this?

346
00:11:31,620 --> 00:11:33,500
拿根绳子绑在那雕塑上
We take a rope, we tie it around the statue,

347
00:11:33,580 --> 00:11:34,760
用我的卡车拉着
attach it to the back of my truck,

348
00:11:34,760 --> 00:11:35,960
把那玩意拖到最近的垃圾场
and drag it to the nearest dump.

349
