-我们不能那样做 -不能
- Uh, we can't do that. - No.

352
00:11:42,780 --> 00:11:44,360
为什么不能 绳子我们有的是
Why not? We got tons of rope.

353
00:11:44,740 --> 00:11:46,741
有没有绳子不是问题
Availability of rope isn't really the issue here.

354
00:11:46,741 --> 00:11:48,820
这么做是破坏他人财物
It's -- it's destruction of property.

355
00:11:48,820 --> 00:11:49,820
是违法的
It's against the law.

356
00:11:50,460 --> 00:11:50,900
所以呢
So?

357
00:11:51,560 --> 00:11:54,280
罗尼 这是文明社会
Ronnie, we live in a civilized society.

358
00:11:54,280 --> 00:11:56,700
我们不是那种人
We're not those kinds of people, you know?

359
