今晚发挥不好
I'm not getting good rotation tonight.

368
00:12:27,100 --> 00:12:28,200
我可是被迷得团团转呢
Certainly made my head spin.

369
00:12:28,380 --> 00:12:30,040
这要我说什么好
Oh, what can I say to that?

370
00:12:31,080 --> 00:12:32,680
我能问你件事吗
Hey, can I ask you something?

371
00:12:33,480 --> 00:12:34,680
你觉得这照片怎么样
What do you think of that picture?

372
00:12:36,160 --> 00:12:37,260
一点都不像你
Doesn't look a thing like you.

373
00:12:37,460 --> 00:12:38,460
我也是这么觉得
Exactly what I've been saying.

374
00:12:39,580 --> 00:12:41,760
绝不是坐在我身旁的这个男人
Not the man sitting next to me.

375
00:12:43,285 --> 00:12:44,635
沧桑帅气的脸
The rugged good looks...

376
00:12:45,140 --> 00:12:45,880
宽阔的肩膀
...broad shoulders...

377
00:12:47,380 --> 00:12:48,200
深邃的蓝眼睛
piercing blue eyes.

378
00:12:48,952 --> 00:12:50,732
你就是凯文·科斯特纳
Hell, you're -- you're somewhere between

379
00:12:50,732 --> 00:12:52,270
和查宁·塔图姆的混合体
Kevin Costner and Channing Tatum.

380
00:12:52,270 --> 00:12:54,143
谁不想跟他俩混交呢
Who wouldn't want to be between them, huh?

381
00:12:55,420 --> 00:12:56,920
杰 到你上场了
Okay, Jay, you're up.

382
00:12:57,077 --> 00:12:59,002
谢谢 你的鼓励正是我需要的
Thank you, Martin. I needed that.

383
00:12:59,002 --> 00:12:59,842
随时奉陪
Anytime.

384
00:13:10,819 --> 00:13:12,586
这才是杰的水平呢
There's the real Jay!

385
00:13:13,060 --> 00:13:14,220
你懂的
You know it!

386
00:13:25,168 --> 00:13:25,780
宝宝在哪
Where is the baby?!

387
00:13:25,780 --> 00:13:26,580
我起了 我起了
I'm up. I'm up.

388
00:13:27,680 --> 00:13:29,120
你什么时候回来的
Hey, when did you get back?

389
00:13:29,200 --> 00:13:30,180
一个小时前吧
Like an hour ago.

390
00:13:30,300 --> 00:13:31,020
真的
Oh, really?

391
00:13:31,060 --> 00:13:33,040
我在打夜店盹呢
I must have grabbed a little disco nap.

392
00:13:33,120 --> 00:13:34,120
那是什么鬼
I don't know what that means.

393
00:13:34,580 --> 00:13:35,820
你们确定要去吗
You sure you guys are up for this?

394
00:13:35,820 --> 00:13:37,500
-当然啦 当然 -必须的
- Yeah, definitely, definitely. - Of course.

395
00:13:37,500 --> 00:13:40,160
要不我们改天再去跳舞吧 比如说白天
Why don't we go dancing another time, like daytime?

396
00:13:40,460 --> 00:13:42,720
我吃奶酪吃得好饱 要不...
Oh, you know, well, I'm pretty full of cheese, so --

397
00:13:42,860 --> 00:13:43,720
不 不行
No, no.

398
00:13:43,760 --> 00:13:45,000
如果我们现在不去
If we don't go out now,

399
00:13:45,140 --> 00:13:47,660
就不是小卡和杰的"老"气在作怪了
this is not about Cam and Jay making us old,

400
00:13:47,760 --> 00:13:49,380
而是我们真的老了
it means we are old.

401
00:13:49,660 --> 00:13:50,800
这是自尊心的问题
This is about pride.

402
00:13:50,800 --> 00:13:53,460
我们必须证明我们还是可以出去浪和嗨的
We need to prove that we can still go out and have fun.

403
00:13:53,540 --> 00:13:55,080
你懂我的意思吗 米奇
Are you with me, Mitch?

404
00:13:55,100 --> 00:13:55,600
懂
Yes!

405
00:13:55,800 --> 00:13:56,940
-我懂 -那就好
- Yes, I am! - Okay.

406
00:13:57,220 --> 00:13:58,480
-我们走起吧 -好
- All right, let's go. - Okay.

407
00:13:58,660 --> 00:13:59,680
路上能买杯咖啡吗
Can we get some coffee on the way?

408
00:13:59,680 --> 00:14:01,000
-不能喝咖啡 -不喝咖啡
- No coffee! - No coffee!

409
00:14:06,712 --> 00:14:08,170
太棒了 宝贝
Oh, yes, baby!

410
00:14:08,180 --> 00:14:10,500
我们队终于找到最好的状态了
Our team had really found its groove.

411
00:14:12,200 --> 00:14:13,619
我们很快打败了
We quickly eliminated

412
00:14:13,619 --> 00:14:15,740
围兜队和洋娃娃球道队
The Pinafores and Alley Of The Dolls,

413
00:14:16,617 --> 00:14:20,444
来到与我死对头球队的最终对决
putting us in the finals against my archrival.

414
00:14:24,665 --> 00:14:28,580
就像红袜队和洋基队 阿里和弗雷泽
In the tradition of Red Sox/Yankees, Ali/Frazier,

415
00:14:28,580 --> 00:14:29,880
一切终归于
it all came down to

416
00:14:29,880 --> 00:14:32,977
"小闲闲布兰妮"对阵"马丁和基佬们"
The Britney Spares vs. Martin And His Merry Men.

417
00:14:43,160 --> 00:14:45,060
紧张局面一触即发
The tension was building...

418
00:14:45,120 --> 00:14:46,560
谁能在我吃光这些薯条之前
Could somebody please take these fries

419
00:14:46,560 --> 00:14:47,580
把它们拿走
before I eat them all?

420
00:14:47,800 --> 00:14:49,760
情绪逐渐高涨
... and emotions were running high.

421
00:14:50,560 --> 00:14:52,720
那个 杰 我想说
Um, so, Jay, I just, um

422
00:14:52,720 --> 00:14:54,157
我想说不管待会儿怎么样
I just wanted to say that whatever happens,

423
00:14:54,157 --> 00:14:55,940
我都 很高兴认识你
it was, uh, r-really nice meeting you.

424
00:14:55,940 --> 00:14:56,720
也很高兴认识你 马丁
Well, you too, Martin.

425
00:14:56,946 --> 00:14:59,922
我在想 那什么
Uh, d-do -- wondering, I don't know,

426
00:14:59,922 --> 00:15:01,920
你 你愿不愿意改天一起吃个饭
w-w-would you like to have dinner sometime

427
00:15:01,920 --> 00:15:02,818
或者出去逛逛 或者
or maybe hang out or,

428
00:15:02,818 --> 00:15:04,028
-之类的 -我的天 你知道吗
- or something like that? - Oh, geez. You know what,

429
00:15:04,028 --> 00:15:05,320
我 我真的受宠若惊
I'm, I'm, I'm really, really flattered

430
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:06,029
我明白了
Okay, I get it.

431
00:15:06,029 --> 00:15:06,900
-不 不是 -没事 我完全理解
- No, no, it's not. - No, no, I get it, totally.

432
00:15:06,900 --> 00:15:07,580
真的没事 我懂的
No, it's okay. I understand.

433
00:15:07,640 --> 00:15:08,440
非常感谢你 祝你好运
Thank you very much! Good luck!

434
00:15:08,700 --> 00:15:11,440
然后就这样 马丁被瓦解了
And just like that, Martin fell apart.

435
00:15:22,040 --> 00:15:25,260
到了最后一格 完全要看杰的发挥
By the last frame, it was all up to Jay.

436
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:27,840
杰 我们只要再击倒六个球瓶就行了
Okay, Jay, we only need six pins!

437
00:15:34,060 --> 00:15:36,100
六个有多了 各位
I don't think it's gonna be six, guys.

438
00:15:40,107 --> 00:15:42,069
我们赢了 我们赢了
We won! We won!

439
00:15:42,840 --> 00:15:46,440
这是我人生中第五幸福的时刻
This is the fifth-happiest moment of my life!

440
00:15:46,640 --> 00:15:48,360
收养莉莉 和米奇尔结婚
Adopting Lily, marrying Mitchell,

441
00:15:48,360 --> 00:15:49,940
中学橄榄球赛冠军
high-school football championship,

442
00:15:50,160 --> 00:15:51,460
看《魔法坏女巫》的时候坐在
and sitting behind Sarah Jessica Parker

443
00:15:51,460 --> 00:15:51,800
萨拉·杰茜卡·帕克后面
at "Wicked."

444
00:15:54,300 --> 00:15:55,540
来了
All right!

445
00:15:57,020 --> 00:15:57,640
好耶
Okay!

446
00:15:58,980 --> 00:16:02,200
一起来 一起嗨 一起来嗨
Let's do this! Let's do this! Let's do this!

447
00:16:03,300 --> 00:16:04,660
我办不到
I can't do this.

448
00:16:04,660 --> 00:16:05,557
我也不行
Me either.

449
00:16:06,186 --> 00:16:07,721
我们快50了
Ah! We're almost 50!

450
00:16:12,040 --> 00:16:15,300
回家的路 尽管距离不到一英里
The ride home, while less than a mile long,

451
00:16:15,300 --> 00:16:16,160
却如此地漫长
was interminable.

452
00:16:16,160 --> 00:16:17,740
晚餐时建立起来的友谊
Whatever bridges had been built

453
00:16:17,740 --> 00:16:18,640
都破碎了[烧糊了]
were burned,

454
00:16:18,840 --> 00:16:19,890
就像我的鱼
like my fish was,

455
00:16:19,890 --> 00:16:21,440
所以说吃鱼配红酒也不是...
which is why red wine was a --

456
00:16:21,440 --> 00:16:23,680
亲爱的 你没必要为自己解释什么
Hey, honey, you don't have to defend yourself.

457
00:16:24,580 --> 00:16:26,400
只要一喝酒 这女人就分不清青红皂白
When it comes to wine, this woman doesn't see color.

458
00:16:26,500 --> 00:16:28,620
你在她面前放什么 她都会喝
She'll drink whatever's put in front of her.

459
00:16:29,260 --> 00:16:30,160
这下好了
Oh, great.

460
00:16:30,520 --> 00:16:32,040
他们还打了灯光
They put lights on it.

461
00:16:33,180 --> 00:16:34,200
停车
Stop the car.

462
00:16:37,180 --> 00:16:39,580
我们必须处理掉那东西 他们说得对
We have to tear that thing down. They're right.

463
00:16:40,220 --> 00:16:41,160
那是唯一的解决办法
It's the only way.

464
00:16:41,360 --> 00:16:43,360
-什么 -这才像话
- What? - Now you're talking!

465
00:16:43,360 --> 00:16:44,600
这才是那个
There's the girl

466
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:46,701
时不时出现在我春梦里的女孩
that I occasionally have sex dreams about.

467
00:16:46,701 --> 00:16:48,050
对 那是真的 他告诉过我
Yeah, that's true. He told me.

468
00:16:48,050 --> 00:16:50,180
-不 不 这太疯狂了 -说得对
- No, no, no. This is crazy. - Yes.

469
00:16:50,180 --> 00:16:52,560
-别这么做 -你还想再等多少个月
- Don't do this. - How many months do you want to spend

470
00:16:52,560 --> 00:16:55,160
去走那些政府的繁文缛节
trying to fight through some bureaucratic red tape

471
00:16:55,160 --> 00:16:56,599
让他们把那玩意儿给拆掉
to get that thing taken down

472
00:16:56,599 --> 00:16:58,601
-最后被告知我们什么也做不了 -不
- only to be told there's nothing we can do? - Oh, no.

473
00:16:58,680 --> 00:16:59,660
待在车上
Stay in the car.

474
00:17:00,120 --> 00:17:00,840
待在车上
Stay in the car!

475
00:17:02,965 --> 00:17:05,080
-我们怎么弄 -拿着这个 绕过去
- What do we do? - Here, take that. Put it around.

476
00:17:05,080 --> 00:17:06,880
-穿个圈 -好 我来
- Through the loop. - Yeah, I do this.

477
00:17:08,964 --> 00:17:09,765
系好了
Tie it down.

478
00:17:10,658 --> 00:17:12,648
不够长 我把车往后倒一点
It's too short. I got to back the truck up.

479
00:17:13,500 --> 00:17:15,040
不 不行
No! No!

480
00:17:15,040 --> 00:17:16,193
菲尔 你在干嘛 赶紧的 开门
Phil, what are you doing? Come on. Open the door.

481
00:17:16,193 --> 00:17:17,560
-我不能让这事发生 -拜托 伙计
- I can't allow this to happen! - Come on, man.

482
00:17:17,560 --> 00:17:19,360
我是这个社区里有头有脸的一份子
I'm a respected member of the community!

483
00:17:19,720 --> 00:17:20,600
我的广告都登在公交车座上了
I'm on bus benches!

484
00:17:20,780 --> 00:17:23,080
-你也太守规矩了 -开门 快开门
- You're such a boy scout! - Open the door. Open the door.

485
00:17:23,080 --> 00:17:24,700
我想要拆掉那玩意儿的心跟你们一样
I want that thing gone as much as anyone,

486
00:17:24,720 --> 00:17:25,480
但不能以这种方式
but not like this.

487
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:26,660
我要把这辆卡车开走
I'm gonna take this truck.

488
00:17:26,860 --> 00:17:27,900
我要去吃点酸奶冰淇淋
I'm gonna go get some fro-yo.

489
00:17:28,240 --> 00:17:30,420
我建议你们走回家 顺便冷静一下
I suggest you use the walk home to calm down.

490
00:17:30,540 --> 00:17:32,380
一旦冷静下来 你们会感谢我的
Once you have, you're gonna thank me.

491
00:17:33,201 --> 00:17:34,802
菲尔 老天 你在倒车...
Phil. Oh, my god! You're going back...

492
00:17:36,380 --> 00:17:37,200
谢谢你
Thank you!

493
00:17:37,660 --> 00:17:39,480
我以为是前进挡
I thought I was in drive!

494
00:17:42,619 --> 00:17:43,666
菲尔
Phil!

495
00:17:44,033 --> 00:17:44,790
菲尔
Phil!

496
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:48,077
我们今晚太棒了 伙计们
We were awesome tonight, guys.

497
00:17:48,077 --> 00:17:49,700
你觉得我们可以挑战拉拉了吗
Do you think we're good enough to take on the lesbians?

498
00:17:49,700 --> 00:17:50,620
天呐 不能
Oh, god, no.

499
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:53,460
我请大家再喝一轮
One more round on me.

500
00:17:56,725 --> 00:17:57,985
打得好 马丁
Good match, Martin.

501
00:17:59,646 --> 00:18:01,200
你也是 杰 恭喜你
You too, Jay. Congratulations.

502
00:18:01,200 --> 00:18:03,820
谢谢 希望我没有让你失去信心
Thanks. I hope I didn't throw off your game at all.

503
00:18:04,080 --> 00:18:06,200
不 都是我 我总是那样
No. That's all me. I do that.

504
00:18:06,440 --> 00:18:07,660
我总会好高骛远
I get ahead of myself.

505
00:18:08,240 --> 00:18:10,360
制造了期望 越堆越高
Create expectations, build them up.

506
00:18:10,560 --> 00:18:12,020
不用担心我 我会去找个人生导师
Don't worry about me. I'm going to see a life coach.

507
00:18:12,020 --> 00:18:13,458
一切都会改变
It is going to change everything.

508
00:18:13,458 --> 00:18:16,880
听着 今晚我的状态并不好
Well, listen, I wasn't feeling great about myself tonight,

509
00:18:16,880 --> 00:18:18,320
是你帮我摆脱了恐惧
and you helped get me out of that funk.

510
00:18:19,320 --> 00:18:20,660
我不应该这样
And it wouldn't be right

511
00:18:20,660 --> 00:18:22,860
任由你难过下去
for me to let you leave feeling bad.

512
00:18:23,620 --> 00:18:24,610
你是个好人
You're a great guy,

513
00:18:24,610 --> 00:18:28,145
我拒绝你的原因是...
and the reason I turned you down is because...

514
00:18:30,100 --> 00:18:32,460
要大声说出来比我想得要难得多
It's much harder to say out loud than I thought.

515
00:18:35,200 --> 00:18:35,720
我...
I'm...

516
00:18:36,480 --> 00:18:37,600
我不是同性恋
I'm not gay.

517
00:18:38,240 --> 00:18:39,140
你是直男吗
You're straight?

518
00:18:39,320 --> 00:18:40,180
是谁 发生什么事了
Who's what? What's happening?

519
00:18:40,200 --> 00:18:42,240
终于可以说出来了 感觉太好了
Whoa, it feels good to finally tell someone.

520
00:18:42,440 --> 00:18:43,420
四个小时了
For four hours,

521
00:18:43,460 --> 00:18:45,500
我一直害怕会被别人发现
I've been living in fear that I'd be found out.

522
00:18:45,640 --> 00:18:48,080
你们知道那种感觉是怎样的吗
Do you have any idea what that feels like?

523
00:18:51,420 --> 00:18:51,940
好吧
Right.

524
00:18:52,700 --> 00:18:55,000
杰 谢谢你承认了
Jay, thank you for admitting that.

525
00:18:55,100 --> 00:18:56,460
你真是个正直的人
You are a real class act.

526
00:18:57,500 --> 00:18:58,040
取消资格
Disqualified!

527
00:18:58,520 --> 00:18:59,460
你们输了
You lose!

528
00:18:59,800 --> 00:19:01,480
给我 那是我的 老天呐
Give me that! That's mine! Oh, my god!

529
00:19:01,490 --> 00:19:02,930
天呐 冠军
Oh, my god, champions!

530
00:19:02,930 --> 00:19:03,616
我们又是冠军了
We're champions again!

531
00:19:03,616 --> 00:19:05,155
-让我出去 -天呐
- Let me out! - Oh, my god!

532
00:19:05,980 --> 00:19:07,040
你猜怎么着 杰
Guess what, Jay.

533
00:19:07,120 --> 00:19:08,560
你是我新的死对头
You're my new archrival.

534
00:19:12,260 --> 00:19:14,060
我觉得很糟
I feel terrible.

535
00:19:14,701 --> 00:19:16,616
-你太守规矩了 童子军 -是啊
- You're too good, boy scout. - Yeah.

536
00:19:16,616 --> 00:19:18,660
所以你才需要有我们这样的人在身边
That's why you need people like us around.

537
00:19:18,660 --> 00:19:20,840
承认吧 你很高兴看到那玩意儿被毁了
Admit it -- you're happy it's gone.

538
00:19:20,840 --> 00:19:22,220
我很高兴
I'm happy it's gone,

539
00:19:22,240 --> 00:19:23,440
不过很奇怪 我们都坐在外面
but it's weird we're out here

540
00:19:23,440 --> 00:19:24,940
而不是关着灯躲在屋里面
instead of inside with the lights off.

541
00:19:25,280 --> 00:19:27,440
这就叫做欲盖弥彰
It's called hiding in plain sight.

542
00:19:27,440 --> 00:19:30,280
我们就坐在这里表现出胸怀坦荡的样子
We just sit here and act like we got nothing to hide,

543
00:19:30,280 --> 00:19:31,820
他们就不会怀疑我们
and they won't suspect a thing.

544
00:19:33,280 --> 00:19:34,860
各位 我要问你们几个问题
Folks, I need to ask you a couple of questions.

545
00:19:35,340 --> 00:19:37,520
有人说他们听见有辆卡车把雕塑撞倒了
Someone said they heard a big truck run over that statue.

546
00:19:37,940 --> 00:19:40,040
什么 我们什么也不知道
What? Well, we wouldn't know anything about that

547
00:19:40,040 --> 00:19:41,100
我们刚才在外面吃晚餐
because we were at dinner.

548
00:19:41,380 --> 00:19:42,500
介意我看一下你的卡车吗
Mind if I take a look at your truck?

549
00:19:42,620 --> 00:19:43,240
你好 巴迪[伙计]
Hey, Buddy.

550
00:19:43,500 --> 00:19:45,300
别管警察叫伙计 他们讨厌那样
Oh, don't call a cop "Buddy." They hate that.

551
00:19:45,360 --> 00:19:46,020
不 那是他的名字
No, that's his name.

552
00:19:46,060 --> 00:19:46,920
我卖过他一套公寓
I sold him a condo.

553
00:19:47,200 --> 00:19:49,040
-菲尔 -是我 巴迪
- Phil? - Yeah, Buddy.

554
00:19:49,619 --> 00:19:52,360
我们四个刚才在吃晚餐 我可以担保
The four of us were at dinner. I can vouch for it.

555
00:19:52,360 --> 00:19:53,480
如果你要找罪人的话
If you're looking to solve a crime,

556
00:19:53,520 --> 00:19:55,228
这位女士吃鱼配红酒
this one here had red wine with fish.

557
00:19:55,228 --> 00:19:57,369
是我干的 没错
Oh, I did. I did.

558
00:19:57,500 --> 00:19:59,520
抱歉打扰你们了 祝你们今晚过得愉快
Sorry to bother you. You folks have a good night.

559
00:19:59,700 --> 00:20:00,860
你也是
You too.

560
00:20:02,980 --> 00:20:04,400
我再也不是童子军了
No more boy scout.

561
00:20:04,800 --> 00:20:07,080
看来今晚你要跟亡命之徒一起睡了
Looks like you're sleeping with an outlaw tonight.

562
00:20:07,800 --> 00:20:08,240
是啊
Yes.

563
00:20:08,665 --> 00:20:09,527
我们也加入
Uh, we're in.

564
00:20:10,267 --> 00:20:11,452
-不 我在跟克莱尔说话 -是的
- No, no, I was talking to Claire. - Yeah.

565
00:20:11,452 --> 00:20:12,960
你是说你们对我们没兴趣吗
Are you saying you're not attracted to us?

566
00:20:12,960 --> 00:20:14,801
-没有 没有 -没有 没有
- No, no, no... - No, no, no...

567
00:20:15,440 --> 00:20:16,520
-没有 -没有
- No. - No.

568
00:20:20,320 --> 00:20:21,360
真不可思议
It's unbelievable.

569
00:20:22,380 --> 00:20:23,600
爸妈居然在跟他们
Mom and dad are sitting outside

570
00:20:23,600 --> 00:20:25,142
以前很讨厌的邻居一起坐在外面
with the neighbors they used to hate

571
00:20:25,142 --> 00:20:27,110
谈天说地 就像他们是最好的朋友似的
yukking it up like they're all best friends.

572
00:20:27,500 --> 00:20:28,380
为什么呢
And why?

573
00:20:28,540 --> 00:20:29,660
因为有酒吗
Because there's wine?

574
00:20:29,920 --> 00:20:31,800
不 因为艺术
No. Because of art.

575
00:20:32,240 --> 00:20:34,140
那个雕塑太令人不悦了
That statue that was so offensive

576
00:20:34,140 --> 00:20:35,320
引发了他们的话题
provoked a conversation.

577
00:20:35,900 --> 00:20:38,620
那就是艺术的力量 会使人凝聚起来
That's what art does. It brings people together.

578
00:20:38,740 --> 00:20:39,660
即使很恶心也行吗
Even if it's gross?

579
00:20:39,840 --> 00:20:41,860
有人觉得恶心 可有人觉得美丽
One person's gross is another person's beautiful.

580
00:20:42,100 --> 00:20:44,060
那真的很强大
Wow. That's really powerful.

581
00:20:44,900 --> 00:20:46,399
你认为这也可以让人们凝聚起来吗
Do you think this could bring people together?

582
00:20:46,399 --> 00:20:49,260
这是我老二的自画像
It's a self-portrait of... my junk.

583
00:20:49,260 --> 00:20:50,620
不许再跟我说话
Never speak to me again.

584
00:20:51,360 --> 00:20:51,880
伪君子
Hypocrite.
